"EF1 spike control B: plain :io monadic block with churn, no do-monad"

` :suppress
sum-range(n): range(1, n) foldl(+, 0)

` :suppress
churn-a: repeat(100) take(300) map(sum-range) foldl(+, 0)

` :suppress
churn-b: repeat(101) take(300) map(sum-range) foldl(+, 0)

` :main
main: { :io
  a: io.shell("echo alpha-{churn-a}")
  b: io.shell("echo beta-{churn-b}")
}.([a.stdout, b.stdout])
